{"id":"4e70aa52bbf815a8","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-supermartingale.md","title":"非负二进制上鞅","display":"df-supermartingale — 非负二进制上鞅","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-supermartingale","aliases":["43-df-supermartingale"],"display":"df-supermartingale — 非负二进制上鞅","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.1.1 Definition 10.1.2，印刷206，PDF226","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-supermartingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-supermartingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supermartingale — 非负二进制上鞅"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.1.1 Definition 10.1.2，印刷206，PDF226"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；有限串及附加运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supermartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Supermartingale}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)\\iff\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;2d(\\sigma)\\ge d(\\sigma0)+d(\\sigma1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)\\iff\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;2d(\\sigma)\\ge d(\\sigma0)+d(\\sigma1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>允许丢弃资本；本节点不要求有效性。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1.1 Definition 10.1.2，印刷206，PDF226。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；有限串及附加运算见 [[43-df-string]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Supermartingale}","display":false},{"tex":"d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)\\iff\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;2d(\\sigma)\\ge d(\\sigma0)+d(\\sigma1).","display":true}],"bytes":1075,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca2fbe2bdf667589","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。$\\mathrm{LowerSemicomputable}$ 见 [[43-df-left-c.e.-function]]，鞅与上鞅见 [[43-df-martingale]]、[[43-df-supermartingale]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-supermartingale]] — 非负二进制上鞅"},{"id":"32253bde8f000c05","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $d$ 是非负上鞅（see [[43-df-supermartingale]]），$a>0$ 为实数；$\\varepsilon$ 是空串，$\\mu$ 为固定的公平硬币测度，柱集见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"f2cc5f0641c3417d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Supermartingale}(d)$（see [[43-df-supermartingale]]），$\\nu\\in2^{<\\omega}$。设 $F\\subseteq\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\nu\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(F)$（see [[43-df-prefixfree]]）；$\\sqsubseteq$ 采用 [[43-df-prefix]] 的非严格前缀关系，允许F无限。"}],"outgoing":["1cb4649e6af56ba4"]}